# The harness's own ignores, kept here rather than in the repository root's,
# because this directory exists only on the perf/ branch and main's .gitignore
# should not carry lines for a directory it never has.
#
# The root file names every binary this repository can produce, for the reason
# recorded there: a binary named after its own directory carries no extension,
# so no pattern anyone would think to write catches it, and a 4.3 MB one
# reached main once already.
/perfreport
/bench

# Raw measurement output. The published results file is generated from it and
# embeds it verbatim; the intermediates themselves are not committed.
/bench.txt
/stat.txt
/stat.csv
